							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "A space tally counts the instances of every class and their memory, per class, package and repository. It needs no knowledge of the object model and takes about a second, even with a heap of a few gigabytes. It does not say why the objects are alive."
						},
