							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-17T23:17:30.08355+01:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-17T23:18:34.376882+01:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "UH7VPUgXRveICf1RGyDnSg=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "Combine both: take the largest classes of a space tally and tag their instances. The Tags view of the estimate then shows, for each class, the memory of its instances in each category. What the space tally counts and no root reaches is held elsewhere, for example by processes or by the virtual machine. The default boundary stops at processes, so their stacks (`Context` objects) are not walked; to include them, use `boundary: (GtMemorySpaceBoundary new stopAtCodeEntities; yourself)`."
						},
						{
							"__type" : "pharoSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-17T23:17:30.083792+01:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-17T23:17:30.083792+01:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "J/T64a/pTZa6kE9ktCt+2A=="
							},
							"code" : "| largestClasses definition |\nlargestClasses := ((GtSpaceTally new systemWideSpaceTally asArray\n\tsort: [ :a :b | a spaceForInstances > b spaceForInstances ])\n\t\tfirst: 5)\n\t\tcollect: [ :each | Smalltalk globals at: each analyzedClassName ].\ndefinition := GtMemorySpaceRootsDefinition new\n\trootGroup: GtMemorySpaceRootGroup classSideState;\n\trootGroup: GtMemorySpaceRootGroup globals;\n\ttagEachOf: largestClasses;\n\texpectedObjects: 5000000;\n\tyourself.\ndefinition estimate"
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
