				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Recipe 3: who holds the largest classes"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-17T23:17:30.203236+01:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-17T23:17:30.203236+01:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "NGIqTJTQQ22lGo7fsOkDFA=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "- **Order matters.** In a running image, the Bloc universes reach almost every object through the UI. Estimate specific roots first, or stop at UI classes such as `BlSpace` and `BlElement`.\n- **Results are estimates.** Memory reachable from several roots goes to the first one; weak references and the keys of ephemerons are not followed; the walk stops at code entities and, by default, at processes.\n- **Cost.** The time grows with the number of objects reached, and the set of visited objects needs memory too. Use `expectedObjects:` for large walks.\n- **A long-running image is not a saved image.** Its heap also holds the objects of the UI, of tools and of the user, and can be many times larger than the image file.\n- **For agents.** Run long estimations in a background process at a low priority (for example `forkAt: 20`), and write a summary to a file or keep the estimation in a variable. {{gtClass:GtMemorySpaceViewsCheck}} checks that the views of a result can be computed."
						}
					]
