							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "QaQsshmgR/qm22l+hv5evw=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "{{gtClass:GtImageStateMemoryMetrics}} applies the model to the whole image: the objects that are not code entities, attributed to the GT Book, the code index, the other Lepiter databases, the class-side state of all classes and the globals. Code entities are measured by {{gtClass:GtMemoryMetrics}}, and what no root reaches is reported as not reached. To explain the size of the image on disk, compute it in a freshly started image, or in the build before saving."
						},
